            <div xml:id="m-506437db-1289-44b0-92dc-20f14057c940">
              <lg xml:id="m-be2007a7-2262-4d23-8299-e71787a6eb42">
                <l xml:id="m-41bdde1b-1bfc-4b6e-9554-b37d09c79e52" facs="#m-46abf452-b51a-45fc-ba41-f885d1a3bf5b" label="text-like">1240 Common of a Holy Woman not a Martyr. Mass.</l><l xml:id="m-61fb53b7-105a-4266-92ee-86874446912e" facs="#m-7c87dd2f-c1d9-4a55-a02d-754171a82ea6" label="lyrics-like">deditque praedam domésticis suis, séderit cum senatóribus terrae. Sín¬</l><l xml:id="m-dcaa3397-13c7-4277-9bc0-2001bf0ced37" facs="#m-c9bc54da-32fa-488f-aead-3192eab46455" label="lyrics-like">donem fecit, et véndidit, et cingu¬</l><l xml:id="m-93dbb2f4-5140-4820-839b-0259c79678e1" facs="#m-2bd9ab84-0234-419f-97a5-06a30479dcd0" label="lyrics-like">et cibaria ancillis suis. Considerávit</l><l xml:id="m-13ef5cdd-55e8-408a-a256-4ef391d477ee" facs="#m-44ccc218-7506-4ae1-a041-153711fe878c" label="lyrics-like">lum trádidit Chananaéo. Fortitúdo</l><l xml:id="m-bcbcfae5-57f8-408c-bb3a-cde2c81f8775" facs="#m-7d3552a1-ecc2-4eb0-aa90-141414a02bbe" label="ambiguous">agrum, et emit eum: de fructu</l><l xml:id="m-59a78cfb-9193-4ecf-86a7-4f689061f4fe" facs="#m-7580714d-4b79-45d6-a108-7a41fd48dcf2" label="lyrics-like">et decor induméntum ejus, et ridé¬</l><l xml:id="m-d24e6df1-feec-442c-ad80-a4eafe0ba4ea" facs="#m-21e0136e-5ed3-4928-b8da-84a9231453aa" label="lyrics-like">mánuum suárum plantávit vineam.</l><l xml:id="m-8fefcc0b-9517-4585-9d18-b9f3b506d46b" facs="#m-b0734936-3540-436c-a61b-79f98a0f2183" label="lyrics-like">bit in die novíssimo. Os suum apé¬</l><l xml:id="m-be0fb0fb-59c5-4769-84cd-56ba8cce56fb" facs="#m-f9ca4861-4028-4977-91d1-cb64f18d56a4" label="lyrics-like">Accinxit fortitúdine lumbos suos,</l><l xml:id="m-746b6e6b-1a71-45c3-a35e-e819f5d8c300" facs="#m-fb193e6d-88a0-4e80-aca3-61f09cfefc8a" label="lyrics-like">ruit sapiéntiae, et lex cleméntiaé in</l><l xml:id="m-9407cb1c-7b84-4705-8445-3d931c28ccea" facs="#m-80a8665b-6ce9-4481-8272-f7243f41eeb7" label="lyrics-like">et roborávit bráchium suum. Gustá¬</l><l xml:id="m-f25d815a-f83b-4b8b-a541-e8d2cd507609" facs="#m-c0bbe4a0-1a38-475a-af0e-e3bf982fd5a7" label="lyrics-like">lingua ejus. Considerávit sémitas</l><l xml:id="m-ed555b18-a355-454e-9e6b-88fc5bd2511b" facs="#m-9bd2a4a5-0ef7-4304-8321-fe5231cafc79" label="lyrics-like">vit, et vidit quia bona est negotiá¬</l><l xml:id="m-b238873c-b3f3-4b1e-83f9-7672d2bb16fb" facs="#m-81c6392b-e15b-4314-bc25-db9c9ac10d74" label="lyrics-like">domus suae, et panem ctiósa non</l><l xml:id="m-c0f7234a-9947-4178-bb1e-224338571068" facs="#m-c0db91f8-a0cb-4efe-ae25-28ae1746a0a4" label="lyrics-like">tio ejus: non exstinguétur in nocte</l><l xml:id="m-c4d4b78d-2e49-43f2-bdea-f0aa5ed00ec1" facs="#m-24713e76-3b75-4164-81cd-1c3d2f74ef3a" label="lyrics-like">comédit. Surrexérunt fllii ejus, et</l><l xml:id="m-478e2f48-311a-45b5-83a2-142877c035bf" facs="#m-768c5a2e-86d1-4fe5-85ef-4957a2fba63e" label="lyrics-like">lucérna ejus. Manum suam misit</l><l xml:id="m-747892aa-8cc9-4ed5-ab79-eec45f1fe3e6" facs="#m-9db3ea97-32bd-4e66-920a-49e40fbe57c5" label="ambiguous">ad fortia, et digiti ejus apprehen¬</l><l xml:id="m-4a8d1965-ce71-4b45-b018-6ffe8d38752e" facs="#m-b0b087d2-712d-4b4d-95f3-2895daafc49c" label="lyrics-like">beatissimam praedicavérunt: vir</l><l xml:id="m-409c4c97-3b5d-4007-add5-ebdf135945c8" facs="#m-7592959a-2903-4b56-b968-c731a22e6836" label="lyrics-like">ejus, et laudávit eam. Multae flliae</l><l xml:id="m-655f6a8f-c9d6-4878-bccd-278cafbb70aa" facs="#m-9a568258-e81d-47a7-abd4-4babb41d922c" label="lyrics-like">dérunt fusum. Manum suam apé¬</l><l xml:id="m-565fb5d1-d6b5-4e0f-a79f-ac39ed343281" facs="#m-09bf48da-3df1-4f51-8624-578866df4694" label="lyrics-like">congregavérunt divitias : tu super¬</l><l xml:id="m-f58fe2ca-6566-4eb6-bfa0-aef0d59ffa61" facs="#m-8d497cee-407f-4d8f-aa22-a0abdcc56e5d" label="lyrics-like">ruit inopi, et palmas suas exténdit</l><l xml:id="m-ac021469-f7c2-4de1-a399-5162b4fc4448" facs="#m-fa9a8286-4ce9-4464-a6b8-a72c1dc49cbc" label="lyrics-like">gréssa est univérsas. Fallax grátia,</l><l xml:id="m-4dce1cae-1ff2-4fd9-b63f-86631c61314a" facs="#m-b6a80522-cd59-4764-b882-4d26c763c9fd" label="lyrics-like">ad páuperem. Non timébit dómui</l><l xml:id="m-34dba53e-f32c-458c-893a-24778b2b9ddd" facs="#m-b87b493b-63f9-488f-8a99-f62c7563d1a8" label="lyrics-like">ét vana est pulchritúdo: múlier</l><l xml:id="m-b0cfcd73-1c78-44a3-b342-5d479f29d55d" facs="#m-21327a0b-743e-4952-b375-d9f9bf00f1fe" label="lyrics-like">suae a frigóribus nivis : omnes enim</l><l xml:id="m-153cec25-3725-4b30-95ea-2599559de2d7" facs="#m-487984d0-7204-439d-97ee-8cbf8798085c" label="lyrics-like">timens Dóminum, ipsa laudábitur.</l><l xml:id="m-7b8f9dfe-5252-4c12-9f72-1be8a25a0917" facs="#m-aa29cd6d-dfa3-40ad-a998-56b072a1f785" label="lyrics-like">doméstici ejus vestiti sunt duplici¬</l><l xml:id="m-d0a4d950-52fb-4d94-87b6-f5ecd7bcf84d" facs="#m-e47817d2-f150-4db4-b75e-7d47b32509b6" label="lyrics-like">Date ei de fructu mánuum suárum:</l><l xml:id="m-5ce0c48b-5596-4dc8-bf5c-6af3e726bb4b" facs="#m-ce56fc61-d68c-4eaf-9bcd-402773ae4483" label="lyrics-like">bus. Stragulátam vestem fecit sibi:</l><l xml:id="m-ca94890c-7f24-4ebe-bfb9-b426eada7c51" facs="#m-fd4150b2-8a56-424a-936c-b4c408eeba4f" label="lyrics-like">byssus et púrpura induméntum ejus. et laudent eam in portis ópera ejus.</l><l xml:id="m-b08245ce-c169-449d-afbb-785d2040a0aa" facs="#m-18092a5d-8990-49e9-b484-214c04c133a5" label="lyrics-like">Nóbilis in portis vir ejus, quando</l><l xml:id="m-02e03f8f-0277-4465-b4d5-0ba099c0a1e3" facs="#m-239f58ed-1f81-4f6c-984e-8b5308712ad4" label="ambiguous">Grad.E</l><l xml:id="m-4a7a9a4d-2bd1-4d58-b935-4d15e0fa3344" facs="#m-d6dcdc03-63a1-447b-a9ea-f7c406d9ff15" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-747edb49-d903-494a-a49a-3d9b02d5dd8a" facs="#m-a7afcba5-5e71-40b2-9eca-ec59ba699cc6" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-878d4593-6060-4b59-be6e-7c04483e77b1" facs="#m-bbd6730d-8b15-4f5b-8f01-a44c6188b004" label="lyrics-like">in lá- bi¬ is</l><l xml:id="m-021de7ed-24e3-474f-8160-03970bdf979a" facs="#m-a55eb593-6739-4b08-a701-3df6074e30d9" label="lyrics-like">Iffú-sa est</l><l xml:id="m-608e7f99-696e-418c-8646-c85ea02eccad" facs="#m-5fc5654d-ee36-4319-8289-13a80b19219e" label="lyrics-like">"grá¬ ti¬ a</l><l xml:id="m-cbc6944e-b9a6-4f7d-870f-0b8fa4788bf5" facs="#m-b188e59c-d8ce-4313-90a6-e9ac1816d6d3" label="lyrics-like">tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-76c9cd9c-bffe-4257-936f-e426968a4441" facs="#m-33fe2159-6d0b-4d3a-b791-22bee8c882bd" label="ambiguous">bene¬</l><l xml:id="m-d5f8a40d-058b-43b7-a406-cfd082e21aa4" facs="#m-b7de1df6-8174-436a-aff9-be36ca0bb7fa" label="text-like">is:</l><l xml:id="m-f99464c7-2d53-419c-86e8-62f0ee881ed7" facs="#m-88a01cdc-c167-4303-b24f-fc25e9174403" label="lyrics-like">pro-ptér¬e a</l><l xml:id="m-9a0e1ed6-ac20-4b75-bb4a-2d26420f129e" facs="#m-9b6b91a5-8b67-4432-854c-7ccd0728f8a5" label="lyrics-like">dí-xit te Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-6d961433-19a9-4e9b-9c53-1d00d63906de" facs="#m-126f14b6-d1f1-4b58-92a6-aa7f8a62a933" label="ambiguous">in</l><l xml:id="m-69611fb1-e62f-4a23-ac12-281fe2525854" facs="#m-eba501b1-9d4a-49aa-84c7-690af2702a73" label="lyrics-like">ae¬ tér¬</l><l xml:id="m-5bcf28ef-250a-474c-9a97-e2528171488a" facs="#m-7354ef64-82a1-43d6-aed4-7cc46c440756" label="ambiguous">num.</l><l xml:id="m-b4b5b4a8-dba6-44c1-8df6-8481c5e867ab" facs="#m-5cb16552-ae8a-4c96-92ca-163214623361" label="ambiguous">us</l><l xml:id="m-ee280ede-ba93-445d-a8f8-8f36a3dfc1ab" facs="#m-7811d919-1227-4b6f-bc90-f0bf189934bc" label="lyrics-like">V. Propter ve-ri-tá¬</l><l xml:id="m-496048e1-8881-44db-9fd0-199193f6e7c1" facs="#m-e73fa949-4d58-4292-95a3-c3c3fbbedb2d" label="ambiguous">tem, et</l><l xml:id="m-5b94dd4f-5047-4a2b-a95d-d3f0e6da8fc3" facs="#m-cbb40b73-b902-4777-8254-0cebe72a2f0e" label="lyrics-like">mansu-e-túdinem,</l><l xml:id="m-6abccbad-deb2-4756-be6f-1bc1ce43402f" facs="#m-3ccfe1f0-2bff-410c-85d0-4c2876245cb6" label="ambiguous">et ju¬</l><l xml:id="m-064228c5-d880-4a94-b454-000f4f5afe5d" facs="#m-52f961bb-e162-46f9-a7c4-a3a634daea01" label="lyrics-like">stí¬</l><l xml:id="m-4277ed6b-c025-4dc7-ab3c-4a77ea7ae7c9" facs="#m-e426c642-f77b-4eff-b118-6b35d97c1e91" label="lyrics-like">et dedúcet</l><l xml:id="m-9bec4da8-fa97-4a2a-bb74-0ecdbb092036" facs="#m-bebf018c-e41c-49f4-90f7-66e887feee90" label="ambiguous">ti-am:</l><l xml:id="m-9fcbc241-153b-4393-bad5-9af711a4fd10" facs="#m-1a91aa6b-33c9-47a6-bc19-2a8798d8a6ff" label="ambiguous">te mi-ra¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>